[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3913534137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116393#issuecomment-3913534137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393","id":3913534137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pQ8q5","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T09:57:18Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T09:57:18Z","body":"This isn't necessarily a bug. That's how Godot is designed to work with settings which may be dependent on configuration (plugins, tool scripts, engine modules, extensions).\n\nEditor settings are shared between projects so even if you disable a plugin in a project, it doesn't mean that its settings aren't still relevant for another project using the same plugin.\n\nAnd even if the settings are only relevant in a single project, there are valid use cases for wanting to temporarily disable a plugin (or it temporarily breaking due to engine changes) and you wouldn't want to lose your configuration in that case.\n\nWhat should be done IMO is just to highlight visually which settings are currently unused in a given project/editor build (and maybe provide a tool to clean up outdated settings).\nSee this proposal for details: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3526","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3913534137/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915933796","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116393#issuecomment-3915933796","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393","id":3915933796,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7paGhk","user":{"login":"FernandoH-G","id":23583398,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTgzMzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23583398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G","html_url":"https://github.com/FernandoH-G","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T17:06:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T17:06:55Z","body":"I get that for when a plugin (or configuration) is disabled. However, in the case where the plugin is deleted, the user is intending for the plugin to be removed from their 'system'. At that point it doesn't make sense to me to have any trace of it's old configuration. Yeah, it might be a hassle to re-configure it again if you plan on installing it later, but hey you could have just disabled it, not deleted it.\n\nNot to mention that if there is no way to 'purge' an addon's configuration, it might cause issues with future installations where errant configs clash with newer/reworked settings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915933796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915960883","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116393#issuecomment-3915960883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393","id":3915960883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7paNIz","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T17:12:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T17:12:57Z","body":"As I mentioned though, if you delete a plugin in a project, that doesn't mean it's deleted from all other projects where you might be using it. And editor settings are for the editor and shared across projects. So removing the settings for that plugin when you remove it from project A might break the configuration you were using in project B.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915960883/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3922008919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116393#issuecomment-3922008919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393","id":3922008919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pxRtX","user":{"login":"FernandoH-G","id":23583398,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTgzMzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23583398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G","html_url":"https://github.com/FernandoH-G","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoH-G/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T17:03:31Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T17:03:31Z","body":"Yeah, I guess given the way plugins work across projects, it might complicate the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3922008919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4628606984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116393#issuecomment-4628606984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393","id":4628606984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE-LwCA","user":{"login":"giokhmaladze","id":7861548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjE1NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7861548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze","html_url":"https://github.com/giokhmaladze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T05:44:43Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T05:44:43Z","body":"For anyone wondering you can manually remove those entries:\n\n- Open godot project:\n- Editor > Open Editor Data/Settings Folder\n- Close godot editor\n- Open in text editor: editor_settings-[version].tres\n- Remove entries\n\nIf you don't close godot editor before editing .tres file godot will overwrite edited settings...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4628606984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]